	(text "Stage 3 of 5: control bit 2 (weight 4).\nOutbound pole 1: COM=OIN_i, NC->OOUT_i, NO->OOUT_(i+4 mod 26).\nReturn pole 2:   COM=RIN_i, NC->ROUT_i, NO->ROUT_(i-4 mod 26).\nCTRL = 24 V stage drive, GND = 0 V. Coil pin 1 = +, pin 12 = - (verify polarity)."
